h and documentation, pending exact-event and terms approval"},{"id":"P01","subject":"Welcome to Landshop Dev Pro","headline":"Welcome to Dev Pro.","body":"Your Landshop Dev Pro onboarding request {{application_ref}} is in. We’re delighted you reached out.\n\nOur team will confirm the appropriate programme details and next steps.","whatsapp":"Welcome to Landshop Dev Pro. Your onboarding ref {{application_ref}} is received. We will share your next steps securely.","sms":"Landshop Dev Pro enquiry {{application_ref}} received.","change_note":"Reviewed scenario source: DEV PRO diagram: website onboarding and automated welcome, pending exact-event and terms approval"},{"id":"P02","subject":"Meet your Dev Pro account officer","headline":"Meet your Dev Pro officer.","body":"Your assigned Dev Pro officer is {{account_officer}}.\n\nThe verified contact information is available in your Landshop account.","whatsapp":"Landshop Dev Pro: {{account_officer}} is your assigned account officer. Verify contact details in your secure dashboard.","sms":"Landshop Dev Pro account officer assigned. See secure dashboard.","change_note":"Reviewed scenario source: DEV PRO diagram: after waiting three days update prospect with account officer, pending exact-event and terms approval"},{"id":"P03","subject":"Checking in on your Dev Pro enquiry","headline":"Have we connected yet?","body":"We’re checking that you were able to reach your Dev Pro officer.\n\nIf you’d prefer a callback or need an answer, we’re here for you.","whatsapp":"Hello {{first_name}}, have you spoken with your Landshop Dev Pro account officer yet? Reply if you need assistance.","sms":"","change_note":"Reviewed scenario source: DEV PRO diagram: wait 24 hours and follow-up by text/call, pending exact-event and terms approval"},{"id":"P04","subject":"An update on your Dev Pro enquiry","headline":"Whenever you’re ready.","body":"Your Dev Pro enquiry {{application_ref}} is still available in your account.\n\nIf now is the right time